# Paths follow the two-folder layout:
#   To Transfer on MC/            -> memory card, boot shim
#   To Transfer on USB or Exfat/  -> the launcher itself, plus POPS

# The journal written by the console. One file now - it used to be five
# (BDM_REPORT, BOOT_LOG, LAUNCH_LOG, MEDIA_LOG, PREBOOT_LOG), and the old names
# stay listed so an existing clone does not suddenly want to commit them.
Prism.log
# One file per session now: log/Debug_YYYY-MM-DD_HHMMSS.log
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/log/
BDM_REPORT.txt
LAUNCH_LOG.txt
MEDIA_LOG.txt
PREBOOT_LOG.txt
BOOT_LOG.txt
exfatdb.json

# Local backups and sync databases
*.orig
*.bak
*.2025
sync.ffs_db

# Build artefacts
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/enceladus.elf

# Personal content: ROMs, artwork, titles. The folder STRUCTURE is kept, so a
# fresh clone still gets the layout - only what sits inside is ignored.
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Roms/*/*
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Roms/*/.INFO*
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Roms/*/media/
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Roms/*/media/*
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Roms/*/media/*/
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Roms/*/media/*/*
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Roms/*/media/*/.INFO*

# Saves and save states belong to the player. One folder per console, mirroring
# Roms/ - RetroArch sorts by the content folder, so Roms/megadrive/Sonic.gen
# saves to Saves/megadrive/Sonic.srm. The folder structure is kept, the contents
# are not.
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Saves/*/*
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Saves/*/.INFO*
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/SaveStates/*/*
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/SaveStates/*/.INFO*
*.state
*.srm
*.lpl
*.opt
*.lrtl

# ...except the factory defaults, which ARE ours to ship: they contain .opt and
# .rmp core overrides and are what "reset configuration" restores.
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/LibretroPS2Files/defaults/**

# BIOS and POPStarter binaries are not redistributable
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Bios/*
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/Bios/.INFO*

# A BIOS is never ours, wherever an emulator wants it placed (Ember, TempGBA...).
# Names, not folders, so a new emulator folder cannot slip one through.
**/bios.bin
**/gba_bios.bin
**/scph*.bin
**/SCPH*.BIN
**/PSXONPSP660.BIN
**/psxonpsp660.bin

# RetroArch is a self-contained module: drop an unzipped nightly into
# LibretroPS2Files/ and that is the whole installation. The nightly's own files
# are not ours to ship.
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/LibretroPS2Files/cores/
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/LibretroPS2Files/info/
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/LibretroPS2Files/raboot.elf

# retroarch/ is where the ONE configuration lives. There is no factory copy of it
# any more, so retroarch.cfg and the per-core overrides have to be tracked - they
# are the only copy. The rest of the folder is written by RetroArch at runtime:
# assets, playlists, logs, thumbnails, its own savefiles/savestates (which stay
# empty, since the launcher points it at Saves/ and SaveStates/ instead).
#
# Note the trailing star: "retroarch/" as a directory rule would stop git from
# ever looking inside, and the negations below would never be reached.
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/LibretroPS2Files/retroarch/*
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/LibretroPS2Files/retroarch/retroarch.cfg
!To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/LibretroPS2Files/retroarch/config/

# POPS binaries and PS1 images
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/IOPRP252.IMG
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/POPS.ELF
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/POPS.PAK
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/POPS_IOX.PAK
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/POPSTARTER.ELF
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/PATCH_*.BIN
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/TROJAN_*.BIN
*.VCD

# POPStarter binaries
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/POPStarter/POPSTARTER.ELF
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/POPStarter/PATCH_*.BIN
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/POPStarter/TROJAN_*.BIN

# Local video-mode markers, written by the launcher
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/System/Defaults/NTSC
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/System/Defaults/PAL
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/System/Defaults/ENG
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/System/Defaults/POR
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/System/Defaults/SPA

# The user's own settings and per-game choices
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/System/Config/prism.cfg
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/System/Config/games.cfg

# Tooling
HelperScripts/__pycache__/
HelperScripts/PopsDelay.py
/To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/POPStarter
MESSAGE-TO-BOON.md
MESSAGE-TO-BOON.md
/HelperScripts/Converted
MESSAGE-TO-BOON.md
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/SyncGithubFolder-HDD.ffs_gui
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/SyncGithubFolder-HDD.ffs_gui
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/Prism/SyncGithubFolder-HDD.ffs_gui
*.ffs_gui
PR-MESSAGE.md
/HelperScripts/PopsWork

# Personal FreeFileSync profile: local drive letters, nothing to share
*.ffs_gui
*.ffs_batch
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/IGR_BG.TM2
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/IGR_NO.TM2
To Transfer on USB or Exfat/POPS/IGR_YES.TM2
